{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-feynman-trace-collapse","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:feynman-trace-collapse","kind":"lemma","title":"Path integral collapses to a finite sum on the eigenbasis","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-feynman-eigenbasis-decomposition"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-feynman-trace-collapse"],"tags":["feynman","path-integral","trace-collapse","semisimplicity"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.FeynmanPathIntegrals.trace_collapse","text":"feynman-trace-collapse.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:feynman-trace-collapse\"></a><p><em>Suppose <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_{\\mathrm{phys}} = \\varinjlim V^{\\otimes n}</code> admits the complete eigenbasis of (<a href=\"#lem:feynman-eigenbasis-decomposition\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mass-algebraic-consolidated/mass-algebraic-markov-gram\">eigenbasis decomposition</a>). Then the Feynman path integral</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\langle\\psi_f|\\psi_i\\rangle\n  =\n  \\int \\mathcal{D}\\phi\\,e^{iS[\\phi]/\\hbar}</code></pre>\n<p><em>collapses to a finite weighted sum over the irreducible summands <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_\\lambda \\otimes S_\\lambda</code>. No regularisation is needed because <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V^{\\otimes n}</code> has finitely many irreducible summands due to the semisimplicity of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_n(R, q)</code> at non-root-of-unity <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/feynman-trace-collapse.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"13.13.1","page":"b/lem-feynman-trace-collapse","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.StandardModel.FeynmanPathIntegrals.trace_collapse","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/FeynmanPathIntegrals.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
